--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WEB PARITY (read end-to-end; every branch + t() reproduced)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data source : useDriveDynamicsLatest(vehicleId, INTERVALS.REALTIME) -> DriveDynamicsSnapshot
              lateral_acceleration?:number  longitudinal_acceleration?:number  (g)
              Bound natively via the P1/S8 GForceSource seam (no HTTP in the view).
Numeric pipeline (VERBATIM):
    lateral       = typeof lateral_acceleration === 'number' ? value : null
    longitudinal  = typeof longitudinal_acceleration === 'number' ? value : null
    hasAny        = lateral != null || longitudinal != null
    magnitude     = (lateral != null && longitudinal != null) ? sqrt(lat^2 + lon^2) : null
    each tile     = value != null ? fmtNumber(value, 2) : '—'   unit = "g" (always)
Shared components mapping (web -> native, P4 component-library bundle):
    @/components/layout  Grid            -> LazyVGrid adaptive track (1-up -> 3-up)
    @/components/ui      GlassPanel      -> TSGlassPanel
    @/components/data-display StatCard   -> GForceStatCardView (label+gauge glyph+value+unit, parity)
    @/components/feedback EmptyState     -> TSEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView)
    @/components/motion  FadeIn          -> TSFadeIn (Reduce-Motion aware)
    lucide Gauge                          -> SF Symbol gauge.with.dots.needle.bottom.50percent
Charts/maps : none in this leaf (web source uses neither Recharts nor Leaflet).
i18n keys (5 web parity keys — all PRESENT in GForcePanel.strings):
    dynamics.gForce="Acceleration G-Force"  dynamics.lateral="Lateral"
    dynamics.longitudinal="Longitudinal"    dynamics.combined="Combined"
    dynamics.gForceNoData="No G-force telemetry received yet"
    (+ native chrome: gForce.noReading/live/stale/offline/updating/loading/errorTitle/retry)
States rendered (every one — no hidden surface):
    loading -> stat-card-shaped skeleton grid (never a blank box)
    empty   -> TSEmptyState "No G-force telemetry received yet" (web hasAny=false branch)
    error   -> QueryError peer: title + bound message + Retry affordance (native leaf addition)
    content -> 3-up Lateral / Longitudinal / Combined stat row, TSFadeIn delay 0.05
    stale   -> header freshness chip + one-shot auto-refresh (P4 leaf live-state contract)
    offline -> header chip, cached readings retained, no refetch
Accessibility : header isHeader trait; each tile .combine + verbatim "<label> <spoken>" label;
                grid .contain with joined VoiceOver summary; freshness chip + retry labelled;
                gauge/triangle glyphs accessibilityHidden; Dynamic Type via Font.TS tokens;
                Reduce Motion honoured by TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton.
Telemetry     : GForcePanelModel.start() emits view.opened surface="GForcePanel" (P1/S11),
                asserted once-only by GForcePanelModelTests.testStartEmitsViewOpenedOnce.

